  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PADEO design Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands aims to focus its interventions in Ghana, to do less, but do it better and more flexibly. Therefore, The Netherlands has decided to work through a systems approach and only intervene in those areas with a strong local need and where the Netherlands has specific expertise. The chosen system is &#x2018;Youth entrepreneurship and employability in horticulture. Through this project, a strategy towards &#x2018;Transforming horticulture in Ghana into a vibrant, sustainable and competitive sector&#x2019;  that contributes to youth employment and entrepreneurship will be developed, which guides the interventions from the Netherlands and partners in Ghana in this regard for the coming years.</narrative>
  </description>
